{"id": "De6nbb3oeQT", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Who told you your first story? Your Nani, Dadi, Mummy, Papa? Watch the gold thread till the end 💛\n\nEvery life is a thread. Some threads were there before yours, and some walk beside you only for a while. But one thread never ends: the stories.\n\nNani told us about Ganesha, Hanuman and little Krishna every night. One day her thread ended… but her stories didn’t. They went into ours. And one night, without even noticing, we told the same stories to our own little ones.\n\nPeople leave. Their stories stay. Pass them on. 🪔\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books bring the stories of our gods and goddesses to kids aged 3–10, beautifully illustrated and easy to read aloud at bedtime.\nBooks 1–3, set of 3 for ₹500 👉 rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment the name of the person who told you your first story.\n📌 Save this, and share it with the one who still tells your kids stories.\n\n#RishiKatha #Nani #Dadi #BedtimeStories #IndianMythology StoriesForKids HinduMythology Hanuman Ganesha Krishna IndianParents Grandparents FamilyLove PassItOn KidsBooks", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792928475, "like_count": 3981, "comment_count": 54, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1075942078805932a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.159, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOGHfLN1gY03LeKRAQ6TSzu9U8s5uLg5L9SAQDd_Zqw_xrkr72Ea-MUlXeTuzngImwcS4aNDgXFcdgp7bugt1bGvW0S6qo84cjlCHw.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqtFr6y__iXEcijILfUaM0mBGEXDgtzf6w5eUe-RlSfW7mgp2QdHmYZx5Kg6Uh6SFBb4z_QiffZk8aa7JPRcFM8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=RFutu02EOrUQ7kNvwHlTel9&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=c7Zjm86ieKUMkKpmkWrTOQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_A